1
00:00:00,795 --> 00:00:04,465
How Thelma and Louise of us.

2
00:00:04,465 --> 00:00:07,705
(Bernadette:)Raj, why don't I care
about anything?

3
00:00:07,702 --> 00:00:08,702
(Raj:)I'm sorry?

4
00:00:08,703 --> 00:00:10,533
(Bernadette:)It's my baby.

5
00:00:10,538 --> 00:00:13,038
I-I should care about
nurseries and colors,

6
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:15,170
(Bernadette:)and I don't--
what's wrong with me?

7
00:00:15,176 --> 00:00:19,646
(Raj:)Well, crime-scene photos
near your crib spring to mind.

8
00:00:19,647 --> 00:00:21,847
(Bernadette:)I keep waiting
to feel excited,

9
00:00:21,849 --> 00:00:23,179
(Bernadette:)but it's not happening.

10
00:00:23,184 --> 00:00:26,584
(Bernadette:)What if it
never happens?

11
00:00:26,587 --> 00:00:28,657
(Scene:)Bernadette,
come on, look,

12
00:00:28,656 --> 00:00:30,956
(Raj:)you're overthinking this,
okay?

13
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:33,158
(Raj:)You're gonna be
an amazing mom.

14
00:00:33,161 --> 00:00:34,391
(Raj:)Even if you don't
believe it,

15
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:36,725
(Raj:)I know you have
maternal instincts.

16
00:00:36,731 --> 00:00:39,231
(Bernadette:)Once, I was supposed
to babysit my brothers.

17
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:41,133
Our neighbor found them
naked in the backyard

18
00:00:41,135 --> 00:00:42,705
(Bernadette:)eating crickets.

19
00:00:44,605 --> 00:00:46,005
(Raj:)Happy and well-fed.

20
00:00:46,007 --> 00:00:48,077
(Raj:)You see, that's what
I'm taking from that story.

21
00:00:53,314 --> 00:00:55,144
(Sheldon:)Leonard, can I ask you
a question?

22
00:00:55,149 --> 00:00:56,649
(Leonard:)Is it about the
rotational symmetries

23
00:00:56,651 --> 00:00:57,821
(Leonard:)you should be
figuring out

24
00:00:57,819 --> 00:01:01,019
(Leonard:)or your fake
caffeine problem?

